  "body": "## 1.17.1 (October 28, 2026)\n\n\nBUG FIXES:\n\n* fmt: The original content of a file is now preserved if Terraform experiences an error writing to the original file. ([#39303](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform/issues/39303))\n\n* Always evaluate module policies during destroy plan ([#39455](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform/issues/39455))\n\n* stacks: report every policy result for a replaced resource instead of only one of them ([#39453](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform/issues/39453))\n\n\n",
